color: var(--text-muted);font-size: 0.95rem;margin-top: 1rem;line-height: 1.6}\n\nfooter {border-top: 1px solid var(--border-color);padding: 3rem 2rem;text-align: center;color: var(--text-muted);font-size: 0.85rem}\n\n@media (max-width: 768px) {\n  .hero {grid-template-columns: 1fr;gap: 2rem}\n  \n  .features-grid {grid-template-columns: 1fr}\n  \n  .plan-card {grid-template-columns: 1fr;gap: 1.5rem}\n  \n  header {padding: 1rem}\n  \n  nav a {margin-left: 1rem}\n}\n</style><header>\n  <a href=\"#\" class=\"brand-logo\">冲浪云 // SURFCLOUD</a>\n  <nav>\n    <a href=\"#features\">架构</a>\n    <a href=\"#plans\">规格</a>\n    <a href=\"#faq\">常见问题</a>\n  </nav>\n</header>\n\n<main>\n  <section class=\"hero\">\n    <div class=\"hero-content\">\n      <h1>冲浪云 · 高标准网络连接<br>与路由传输技术</h1>\n      <p>冲浪云构建于多线路融合基础之上，提供低延迟、高吞吐的流量代理与传输方案。我们以严谨的工程标准，确保长周期运行的稳定性与数据传输的私密性。</p>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"hero-panel\">\n      <div>\n        <div class=\"panel-title\">系统状态实时监控</div>\n        <div class=\"spec-grid\">\n          <div class=\"spec-item\">\n            <span class=\"spec-label\">可用性</span>\n            <span class=\"spec-value\">99.9%</span>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"spec-item\">\n            <span class=\"spec-label\">平均延迟</span>\n            <span class=\"spec-value\">28ms</span>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"spec-item\">\n            <span class=\"spec-label\">在线节点</span>\n            <span class=\"spec-value\">48 组</span>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"spec-item\">\n            <span class=\"spec-label\">协议类型</span>\n            <span class=\"spec-value\">专有加密</span>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"spec-label\">\n        规格代码：SC-2026-V3\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section id=\"features\" class=\"features-section\">\n    <div class=\"section-header\">\n      <h2>核心技术特性</h2>\n      <p>从传输协议到边缘路由，每一项参数均经过长期调优。</p>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"features-grid\">\n      <div class=\"feature-card\">\n        <h3>多路智能冗余</h3>\n        <p>系统自动检测并避开拥堵路由，在主干网络波动时无缝切换至备用传输路径，确保连接不中断。</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"feature-card\">\n        <h3>全链路加密传输</h3>\n        <p>采用高强度非对称加密算法，对传输过程中的所有通信数据进行封装，有效防止中间人窥探。</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"feature-card\">\n        <h3>精细化流控机制</h3>\n        <p>通过动态队列分配技术，合理调度各类网络请求的带宽配额，兼顾大文件吞吐与实时交互响应。</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section id=\"plans\" class=\"plans-section\">\n    <div class=\"section-header\">\n      <h2>服务层级与配置</h2>\n      <p>根据不同应用场景的吞吐需求，选择对应的资源配额与线路级别。</p>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"plans-stack\">\n      <div class=\"plan-card\">\n        <div class=\"plan-info\">\n          <h3>基础版</h3>\n          <p>适用于日常网页浏览与轻量数据交互。</p>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"plan-features\">\n          <ul>\n            <li>每月 100GB 极速流量</li>\n            <li>支持 3 台设备同时在线</li>\n            <li>解锁基础流媒体</li>\n            <li>普通线路节点池</li>\n          </ul>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"plan-pricing\">\n          <div class=\"price\">¥15<span>/月</span></div>\n          <div class=\"annual\">按年付仅需 ¥150/年</div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"plan-card featured\">\n        <div class=\"plan-info\">\n          <h3>旗舰版</h3>\n          <p>面向高强度多媒体应用及专业开发者的优化方案。</p>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"plan-features\">\n          <ul>\n            <li>每月 300GB 极速流量</li>\n            <li>支持 5 台设备同时在线</li>\n            <li>全节点原生流媒体解锁</li>\n            <li>IPLC 专线游戏加速优化</li>\n            <li>7x24 优先工单支持</li>\n          </ul>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"plan-pricing\">\n          <div class=\"price\">¥35<span>/月</span></div>\n          <div class=\"annual\">按年付仅需 ¥350/年</div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"plan-card\">\n        <div class=\"plan-info\">\n          <h3>团队版</h3>\n          <p>企业级多端协作与高带宽传输专属通道。</p>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"plan-features\">\n          <ul>\n            <li>每月 1000GB 极速流量</li>\n            <li>支持 20 台设备同时在线</li>\n            <li>VIP 专属高带宽节点</li>\n            <li>支持企业定制路由</li>\n            <li>专属客户经理服务</li>\n          </ul>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"plan-pricing\">\n          <div class=\"price\">¥85<span>/月</span></div>\n          <div class=\"annual\">按年付仅需 ¥850/年</div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section id=\"faq\" class=\"faq-section\">\n    <div class=\"section-header\">\n      <h2>常见技术问答</h2>\n      <p>关于系统配置、客户端兼容性与计费周期的标准解答。</p>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"faq-list\">\n      <details>\n        <summary>如何开始配置与接入冲浪云服务？</summary>\n        <p>在完成账户注册与服务层级选择后，您将获得专属的订阅链接或配置文件。系统支持主流操作系统的各类通用客户端，您只需将链接导入客户端并选择相应节点即可建立连接。</p>\n      </details>\n      <details>\n        <summary>流量额度耗尽后系统如何处理？</summary>\n        <p>当当月分配的极速流量使用完毕后，系统将暂停高速转发通道，或允许您通过工单系统申请按需增加临时流量包。流量数据通常在每个自然月的第一天重置。</p>\n      </details>\n      <details>\n        <summary>不同层级的线路节点有何实际区别？</summary>\n        <p>基础版使用共享带宽的常规中转线路，适合常规访问；旗舰版与团队版则接入了 IPLC 专线及专属 VIP 节点，具备更低的物理延迟、更高的抗干扰能力以及更稳定的吞吐带宽。</p>\n      </details>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n</main>\n\n<footer>\n  <p>© 冲浪云 SurfCloud 技术规格说明文档. 保留所有权利.</p>\n</footer>",
